  "text": "AmberX looked broken (overlapping, wide-spaced text from the Sliders). Fix: Restore default appearance clears the Sliders (axf.look), line height never below 100%, letter spacing capped at 0.1em. New Settings → Appearance → Lock the look (greys out every look control, this device's tweaks set aside, axHub look still applies) and Get the look from axHub (developer apps; off = own saved look, no waiting). Web framework + the five web apps re-baked; Android twin deferred (PORTING.md).",
